      "claim": "官网自述：公司把通用人工智能带入物理世界，团队由工程师、科学家、机器人研究者与创业者组成，开发学习算法以构建控制机器人的模型；发布 π0.7 可引导模型（自述具备泛化能力的阶跃式提升）；从 VLA 模型中提取 RL Token 以支持快速在线强化学习并用少量数据提升精确任务吞吐；多尺度具身记忆（MEM）为模型提供长期与短期记忆，使复杂任务可超过十分钟；官网称通用物理智能模型将带来机器人应用的爆发，并称合作伙伴已在解决真实问题",
      "quote": "Physical Intelligence is bringing general-purpose AI into the physical world. We are a group of engineers, scientists, roboticists, and company builders developing learning algorithms to create a model that will control … π 0.7 : a Steerable Model with Emergent Capabilities — A steerable robotic foundation model that exhibits a step-change in generalization. … We extract an RL Token from VLA models to enable fast online RL and improve throughput on precise tasks with few hours of data. … Multi-Scale Embodied Memory (MEM) gives our models both long-term and short-term memory, enabling complex tasks longer than ten minutes. … General-purpose physical intelligence models will enable a Cambrian explosion of robotics applications. See how our partners are already solving real-world problems.",
